{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47034","headline":"短歌寄鼓山长老 · 齐己","name":"短歌寄鼓山长老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪峰雪峰高且雄，峨峨堆积青冥中。\n六月赤日烧不熔，飞禽瞥见人难通。\n常闻中有白象王，五百象子皆威光。\n行围坐遶同一色，森森影动旃檀香。\n於中一子最雄猛，称尊独踞鼓山顶。\n百千眷属阴□影，身照曜，吞秋景。\n[我]闻岷国民归依，前王後王皆师资。\n宁同梁武遇达磨，过後弹指空伤悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}